Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.20,Hook,,0,0,0,,GTA 6 TIENE TELENOVELA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Es como un capítulo de\NBetty la Fea, amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:05.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Sí, me estoy enganchando\Ncon la novela.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:08.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿Descubrirá José Luis que\Nsu verdadero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:09.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}padre...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:10.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Es Malquita!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.14,0:00:11.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Malquita, el malo este,\Nboludo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:14.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—...el regreso del primo\Nperdido,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:15.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿Cuántos?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:19.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:21.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:25.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cuántos?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cuántos parientes\Nperdidos hay en la vida,\Nno?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:28.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Cuántos?
